nsisco or Seattle, but can easily be moved to any other moderately sized city. The basic plot is that the PCs try to rescue someone they know from a local secret asylum (ie, a prison/reeducation center run by their foes) only to find that some of the inmate may actually belong there.<br /> <br /> <br /> Anyway, such was the outline for an imaginary book that never existed.<br /> <br /> <br /></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Have you ever thought about making Vault Products? You regularly pump out some rather brilliant idea, and even if working on a project as a hobby it could be satisfying. I eventually plan to pump a few dream books out.<br /> <br /> Seriously your setting aesthetics jibes well with a lot of fans I reckon.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-17T17:01:02-07:00","id":1414292,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1413690-changeling-mage-crossover-discussion?p=1414117#post1414117\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Have you ever thought about making Vault Products?</div> </div> </div> </div>I've considered it. It's mostly a time issue, combined with the problem of finding suitable artwork. If I was to, the first two would be a Ravnos related bit for Vampire and something for Scion. <br /> <br /> Incidentally, the companion/follow up to the above would've been Heirs of Avalon, a replacement for Isle of the Mighty, done primarily as Mage book, but with an entire chapter about Changeling, covering England, Scotland and Wales. <br /> <br /> (The others would've been Rio by Night, Rage Across Australia, and Haunted Ireland.)<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>What is tolerance? It is the consequence of humanity. We are all formed of frailty and error; let us pardon reciprocally each other's folly. That is the first law of nature.</i><br /> Voltaire, &quot;Tolerance&quot; (1764)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12890-no-one-of-consequence","name":"No One of Consequence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-17T17:10:39-07:00","id":1414293,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>No One of Consequence</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1413690-changeling-mage-crossover-discussion?p=1414292#post1414292\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I've considered it. It's mostly a time issue, combined with the problem of finding suitable artwork. If I was to, the first two would be a Ravnos related bit for Vampire and something for Scion.<br /> <br /> Incidentally, the companion/follow up to the above would've been Heirs of Avalon, a replacement for Isle of the Mighty, done primarily as Mage book, but with an entire chapter about Changeling, covering England, Scotland and Wales.<br /> <br /> (The others would've been Rio by Night, Rage Across Australia, and Haunted Ireland.)</div> </div> </div> </div>Legend has it if you got Rage Across Australia right the ghost of the Bunyip would come back and shake your hand. Would you wait till we got a Bunyip tribebook, or was that project canceled?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-17T17:22:22-07:00","id":1414297,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1413690-changeling-mage-crossover-discussion?p=1414293#post1414293\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Legend has it if you got Rage Across Australia right the ghost of the Bunyip would come back and shake your hand. Would you wait till we got a Bunyip tribebook, or was that project canceled?</div> </div> </div> </div>When I worked all of that out a decade ago, I think the idea was the RA Australia (this version of it) would've talked about the Bunyip, but not so much about playing them. That would've been a much later Werewolf book, Lost Breeds, that would've talked about them and the lost Fera both for historical chronicles and if one wanted to bring them back (or have never been wiped out). The Australia book would've spent more time talking about both local Changelings and their Aboriginal counterparts.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>What is tolerance? It is the consequence of humanity. We are all formed of frailty and error; let us pardon reciprocally each other's folly. That is the first law of nature.</i><br /> Voltaire, &quot;Tolerance&quot; (1764)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12890-no-one-of-consequence","name":"No One of Consequence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-17T17:45:27-07:00","id":1414302,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1413690-changeling-mage-crossover-discussion?p=1414293#post1414293\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Legend has it if you got Rage Across Australia right the ghost of the Bunyip would come back and shake your hand. Would you wait till we got a Bunyip tribebook, or was that project canceled?</div> </div> </div> </div>What\u2019s wrong with Rage across Australia?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-17T18:01:51-07:00","id":1414306,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Konradleijon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1413690-changeling-mage-crossover-discussion?p=1414302#post1414302\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> What\u2019s wrong with Rage across Australia?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I actually never read it specifically because it has bad reviews, but I want to eventually get it. But Australians always hate it, so I don't know if its only bad because obviously written by folks who aren't Australian or if its because of that and its also bad to boot. I mean I really liked Rage Across Russia, and I thought Rage Across the Amazon was okay.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby"